<title>AUSTRALIA: CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 32 FOR TWO AT LUNCH V WEST INDIES.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-AUSTRALIA 32 FOR TWO AT LUNCH V WEST INDIES.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH, Australia 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia, trailing West Indies by 141 runs on first innings, were 32 for two at lunch on the third day of the fifth and final test at the WACA ground on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores - Australia 243 (Michael Bevan 87 not out, Mark Waugh 79, Curtly Ambrose five for 43) and 32 for two; West Indies 384 all out (Brian Lara 132, Robert Samuels 76).</p>
